  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project aims to support exchange and institutional cooperation        between SCB (Statistics Sweden) and Instituto Nacional de             Estadistica. More in particular, the projects supports the provision  of two long-term consultants from SCB to INE, and a number of shorter exchange missions in areas such as gendered statistics, municipal     statistics etc.</narrative>
